betterquesting.quest.RanZlYxVWlONpA46YxDZ5Q.desc=Mk2 technology base fluid supplies a base of 1.02; the Mk2 core raises this route's exponent to 4. Together they contribute about 1.0824×, before the other route is multiplied in. The technology fluid is planned for UV progression.%n%nThe consumption remains 1 mB per 1000 mB of fuel, regardless of Mk. Bring this core only after installing the previous tiers; swapping base fluids does not install a core.%n%n[note]Reference only: no survival recipe, item submission or material reward is defined for this node.[/note]
