betterquesting.quest.KcZbpymzVGSHtQ31CYqKkg.name=Stars Made in an Assembler
betterquesting.quest.KcZbpymzVGSHtQ31CYqKkg.desc=Voltage Stars package the eight basic component families of a voltage tier: Motor, Piston, Pump, Conveyor Module, Robot Arm, Emitter, Sensor and Field Generator. Start with one of each LV component in an LV Assembler for 8 seconds.%n%nThis is a separate collection and manufacturing branch. Stars are not currently ingredients of fuel, base-fluid or exponent-core recipes. In particular, a star does not upgrade the generator. The tasks below detect one star without consuming it, so it can go straight into the next recipe.
betterquesting.quest.X-qVOHfHVci7ZeJDh4PvVQ.name=LV Star
betterquesting.quest.X-qVOHfHVci7ZeJDh4PvVQ.desc=Use 1 of each of the eight LV components in the Assembler. The recipe uses LV voltage for 8 seconds and makes one LV Star.%n%nThe task only detects the star. It does not consume it, grant another star or unlock a pending generator upgrade.
betterquesting.quest.BR8YirarWLKag9Uw2WHMlg.name=MV Star
betterquesting.quest.BR8YirarWLKag9Uw2WHMlg.desc=Use 2 of each of the eight MV components and 16 stars of the previous voltage tier in the Assembler. The recipe uses MV voltage for 16 seconds and makes one MV Star.%n%nThe task only detects the star. It does not consume it, grant another star or unlock a pending generator upgrade.
betterquesting.quest.EOWA5gmsXv6VSEaGHZ5_sQ.name=HV Star
betterquesting.quest.EOWA5gmsXv6VSEaGHZ5_sQ.desc=Use 4 of each of the eight HV components and 16 stars of the previous voltage tier in the Assembler. The recipe uses HV voltage for 32 seconds and makes one HV Star.%n%nThe task only detects the star. It does not consume it, grant another star or unlock a pending generator upgrade.
betterquesting.quest.HT7de8iAWnqP6lgyum-NWw.name=EV Star
betterquesting.quest.HT7de8iAWnqP6lgyum-NWw.desc=Use 8 of each of the eight EV components and 16 stars of the previous voltage tier in the Assembler. The recipe uses EV voltage for 64 seconds and makes one EV Star.%n%nThe task only detects the star. It does not consume it, grant another star or unlock a pending generator upgrade.
betterquesting.quest.uxvc895BVJu9NN1ZwBbnxA.name=IV Star
betterquesting.quest.uxvc895BVJu9NN1ZwBbnxA.desc=Use 16 of each of the eight IV components and 16 stars of the previous voltage tier in the Assembler. The recipe uses IV voltage for 128 seconds and makes one IV Star.%n%nThe task only detects the star. It does not consume it, grant another star or unlock a pending generator upgrade.
betterquesting.quest.oAmgcbR5VeaMOO3xx32nqQ.name=LuV Star
betterquesting.quest.oAmgcbR5VeaMOO3xx32nqQ.desc=Use 32 of each of the eight LuV components and 16 stars of the previous voltage tier in the Assembly Line. The recipe uses LuV voltage for 256 seconds and makes one LuV Star.%n%nScan the previous star at this tier for 60 seconds to obtain the Assembly Line research. The star recipe has no additional fluid input.%n%nThe task only detects the star. It does not consume it, grant another star or unlock a pending generator upgrade.
